    <div>
      <img src="/images/doodles/cat-doodle.png" alt="" style="width:160px" />
      <h1 style="font-size:48px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:20px 0 10px">这一页走丢了</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">可能链接改过了，试试回首页或者按 ⌘K 搜一搜。</p>
      <a class="btn solid" href="/" style="margin-top:20px">回到首页</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
